    "summaryAr": "Who Should Apply We are looking for developers from all technical backgrounds and language specializations. If you write clean code and understand software design, you are a fit: Software Engineers & Computer Scientists specializing in algorithms, data structures, or system design. Full-Stack & Web Developers working with modern front-end or back-end frameworks (JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Node.js, Python, PHP, Ru",
